00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,660
Excellent work.

266
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:33,160
We'll put her to good use.

267
00:20:34,140 --> 00:20:35,500
Bring her to me.

268
00:20:36,040 --> 00:20:36,880
Yes, sir!

269
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:53,620
Big Crow, hurry!

270
00:20:54,080 --> 00:20:55,140
Save me!

271
00:20:58,440 --> 00:20:59,600
In Kuri,

272
00:20:59,860 --> 00:21:01,797
there lies a place known as Bacala Town,

273
00:21:01,880 --> 00:21:05,233
where pirates and officials
flourish while others starve.

274
00:21:14,460 --> 00:21:16,200
That damn rodent!

275
00:21:17,980 --> 00:21:20,260
Who does he think he is?

276
00:21:20,560 --> 00:21:23,920
The powerful aura of his
gave me pause for a moment.

277
00:21:24,060 --> 00:21:26,360
But I'm not giving up on Kiku.

278
00:21:26,600 --> 00:21:29,480
She will be my bride someday, Pin.

279
00:21:30,200 --> 00:21:35,220
I've got status, I've got fame, and
I've got a safe supply of food to eat.

280
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:39,780
Who could possibly reject
a man like me, Pit?

281
00:21:44,820 --> 00:21:48,240
You gotta stop sweating the
small stuff, you dumb lug.

282
00:21:49,560 --> 00:21:52,540
That gal you fancy's from Okobore Town.

283
