Why does he have a lie in there?

340
00:26:42,560 --> 00:26:44,000
Want to fight?

341
00:26:44,280 --> 00:26:46,162
Haven't learned your lesson yet?

342
00:27:01,440 --> 00:27:03,100
What did he just do?

343
