Savage, that lion always
goes straight for the ball.

344
00:27:10,960 --> 00:27:11,937
Too bad.

345
00:27:12,020 --> 00:27:16,837
Since they share the same body, it's like
the lion is hitting itself in the balls,

346
00:27:16,920 --> 00:27:17,750
too.

347
00:27:18,180 --> 00:27:19,100
It's poetic.

348
00:27:23,760 --> 00:27:25,407
You'd think you would learn.

349
00:27:26,240 --> 00:27:29,980
So, this girl here, what should
we do with her, Master Holder?

350
00:27:30,920 --> 00:27:32,040
Are you listening?

351
00:27:33,460 --> 00:27:35,080
So your name's Tama?

352
00:27:40,320 --> 00:27:45,540
Well, you're clearly weak,
and a little coward to boot.

353
00:27:48,080 --> 00:27:50,540
And yet you tamed that savage baboon!

354
00:27:50,880 --> 00:27:52,080
