power, but how does it work?

358
00:28:24,840 --> 00:28:26,320
Come on, runt.

359
00:28:26,740 --> 00:28:27,940
Spit it out!

360
00:28:31,760 --> 00:28:32,900
Listen, Tama,

361
00:28:33,240 --> 00:28:37,357
