I fear they may target you!

363
00:28:53,280 --> 00:28:55,120
Alright, I'll tell you!

364
00:28:57,020 --> 00:29:03,000
The truth about me is that
I'm real popular with animals.

365
00:29:03,220 --> 00:29:04,220
