366
00:29:06,060 --> 00:29:06,890
Aww.

367
00:29:08,020 --> 00:29:09,840
That is so cute.

368
00:29:10,180 --> 00:29:13,000
And here I thought you had secret powers.

369
00:29:15,340 --> 00:29:16,170
No.

370
00:29:16,340 --> 00:29:17,520
No powers here.

371
00:29:18,940 --> 00:29:21,100
