372
00:29:23,680 --> 00:29:26,480
I'm not screwing around here!

373
00:29:29,800 --> 00:29:31,260
Is it your cheek?

374
00:29:31,640 --> 00:29:32,960
That's what they said.

375
00:29:33,180 --> 00:29:35,560
