The big, scary pair!

380
00:30:13,100 --> 00:30:15,200
Are you there, Big Paul?

381
00:30:28,920 --> 00:30:29,980
He's high!

382
00:30:30,360 --> 00:30:31,940
Help me, Big Paul!

383
00:30:35,820 --> 00:30:36,650
Ahhhh!

384
00:30:36,733 --> 00:30:38,500
I'm coming, come on!

385
00:30:43,860 --> 00:30:45,540
Turn back, you fools!

386
00:30:45,940 --> 00:30:47,880
Only death awaits you here!

387
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:49,440
Don't hold back!

388
00:30:50,500 --> 00:30:52,817
If we can just get past
them, we'll have made it.

389
00:30:52,900 --> 00:30:55,777
Luffy, we don't have time
to waste on these chumps.

390
00:30:55,860 --> 00:30:56,690
Push through!

391
00:30:57,160 --> 00:30:58,560
Feed me to it!

392
00:30:59,680 --> 00:31:01,480
Come on, dog! Charge!

393
00:31:06,300 --> 00:31:07,400
Oh, no!

394
00:31:09,240 --> 00:31:10,070
