395
00:31:12,020 --> 00:31:13,400
There's an emergency!

396
00:31:17,500 --> 00:31:18,720
Do something!

397
00:31:19,720 --> 00:31:22,838
You're gonna have to explain
the problem to me first.

398
00:31:23,560 --> 00:31:26,040
Straw Hat and Roro Noah are here!

399
00:31:27,140 --> 00:31:29,375
So Straw Hat finally made it to Juana.

400
00:31:29,820 --> 00:31:30,680
That's good.

401
00:31:31,020 --> 00:31:31,977
What's the issue?

402
00:31:32,060 --> 00:31:36,780
He and Roronoa are charging straight
into Baccona Town, ready for a fight!

403
00:31:38,360 --> 00:31:39,640
Bunch of fools!

404
00:31:39,960 --> 00:31:42,277
They're going to ruin the whole damn plan!

405
00:31:42,360 --> 00:31:43,840
So it would appear.

406
00:31:45,700 --> 00:31:46,780
What now?

407
00:31:49,580 --> 00:31:50,410
Captain!

408
00:31:53,280 --> 00:31:55,960
Let's go stop them and make it quick!

409
00:31:56,680 --> 00:31:57,800
Go on, Captain!

410
