If you want me to stop, then
show me that ability of yours.

411
00:32:36,840 --> 00:32:38,080
TAMAAAAAAA!

412
00:32:54,060 --> 00:32:54,890
Huh?

413
00:32:54,973 --> 00:32:56,980
